{"title":"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd16daa5df6d07795d019cfdbdb4ffd3dfd9ca9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_1(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" /> denote the square of the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.  For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317096889b84df0b72bf69ceb4c82208305f1b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15da1173a22ee9472e09856cc40cf7013d70e5f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_n(k) = f_1(f_{n - 1}(k))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />.  Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0906fbd1219a768e8e611faad932bf527c08c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1988}(11)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55048e9ff5bbf7372887db2a74d230bf91d6a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1}(11)=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af7c25d6639450d40870830560d11652e6bddfd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_2(11) = f_1(4)=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/3/9d3b75d5a241c390a583fa4dbf7cfb8c623c2b79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_3(11) = f_1(16)=49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf8014189ae1d69032c0772d6acea6a40955f4f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_4(11) = f_1(49)=169$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/d/f9d639f20e2562150a6ce49e0080f118a400d48c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_5(11) = f_1(169)=256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a3b625d635bfeb10cfe0b94d570132fa70b7580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_6(11) = f_1(256)=169$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Note that this revolves between the two numbers. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb87b8dcec4cffd762f5044163191496cf3cfc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1988$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is even, we thus have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b6b11cef380850a56ecfcd8e3ba307214cefb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1988}(11) = f_{4}(11) = \\boxed{169}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"206\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME\" title=\"1988 AIME\">1988 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016205626\nCache expiry: 86400\nRedu